{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo now for free.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a neon-lit dystopia full of exciting challenges in Nion Forge - the action-packed <strong>cyberpunk roguelite</strong>! Here you have the opportunity to <strong>build your own spaceship</strong> and fight above the dystopian streets as you face off against hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be surprised by unique upgrades and weapons that make every playthrough a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4b3f2fce027b665a4be073dc1d23b4c0.poster.avif?t=1765490532\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4b3f2fce027b665a4be073dc1d23b4c0.webm?t=1765490532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4b3f2fce027b665a4be073dc1d23b4c0.mp4?t=1765490532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Nion Forge, you combine auto-firing weapons and special cockpit abilities and weapons to actively and passively take on masses of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by selecting the best ship parts and perfecting your own play style can you master all 9 districts and defeat their bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you be the first fighter to escape the city arena and attain your freedom?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/c26c7eab018c12761cfae6317b10d989.webp?t=1765490532\" width=800 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/a6a304cedd343e169d17121ee2935e51.webp?t=1765490532\" width=370 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/bb91f513248a328cee77f771ac666369.webp?t=1765490532\" width=800 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile or powerful? What weapons, what drive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ship to suit your style and be better prepared next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4d4d597399498a6c86d000818734d0f5.poster.avif?t=1765490532\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4d4d597399498a6c86d000818734d0f5.webm?t=1765490532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/4d4d597399498a6c86d000818734d0f5.mp4?t=1765490532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/c26c7eab018c12761cfae6317b10d989.webp?t=1765490532\" width=800 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/b7348d0010afb5fc7ab211bbb511c3c0.webp?t=1765490532\" width=365 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/bb91f513248a328cee77f771ac666369.webp?t=1765490532\" width=800 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ever-growing hordes of enemies and battle ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/8fdc90199e2a1b17bbdb61db6d35c29d.poster.avif?t=1765490532\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/8fdc90199e2a1b17bbdb61db6d35c29d.webm?t=1765490532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/8fdc90199e2a1b17bbdb61db6d35c29d.mp4?t=1765490532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... until you're ready for the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/74cb7d0a772e26705d1a8a964427a905.poster.avif?t=1765490532\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/74cb7d0a772e26705d1a8a964427a905.webm?t=1765490532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/74cb7d0a772e26705d1a8a964427a905.mp4?t=1765490532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat all 9 levels and bosses within a limited time to escape the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/c26c7eab018c12761cfae6317b10d989.webp?t=1765490532\" width=800 height=25 /></span></p><p